#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:7 95e09a62a3b9460f8214e6617146f217
msgid ""
"ArduPilot Rover 4.1 (and higher) includes basic support for four legged "
"walking robots.  More details can be found in `this GSoC 2020 blog post "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2020-walking-robot-support-for-"
"ardupilot/57080>`__"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot Rover 4.1（及更高版本）包含对四足步行机器人的基本支持。更多详情见 `2020年 GSoC 博客文章 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2020-walking-robot-support-for-"
"ardupilot/57080>`__。"

