#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:23 624ad26dce8649b5bae424a7465b4cbb
msgid ""
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible autopilot <common-autopilots>` with at least 12 "
"PWM outputs and ideally with the powerful STM32H7 CPU to give enough memory "
"to run :ref:`Lua scripts <common-lua-scripts>` easily"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot 兼容自动驾驶仪 <common-autopilots>`，需至少12路 PWM 输出，理想情况下配备强大的 "
"STM32H7 CPU，以提供足够内存轻松运行 :ref:`Lua 脚本 <common-lua-scripts>`。"

