#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:130 b742ff88090e4e33bd9dc4bf7ce7bf28
msgid ""
"Set a :ref:`transmitter switch<common-auxiliary-functions>` for arming. "
"Ensure the channel used for the switch has been :ref:`calibrated<common-"
"radio-control-calibration>`. To configure a channel for arming, for example "
"channel 7, then set the parameter:"
msgstr ""
"为解锁设置 :ref:`发射机开关<common-auxiliary-functions>`。确保用于开关的通道已经过 :ref:`校准<common-"
"radio-control-calibration>`。例如，将通道7配置为解锁功能，设置参数："

#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:132 e13fc99c6c854abe80477794a086cbc6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` =41 (Sets function of channel 7 as "
"arming/disarming)"
